        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> Sell &amp; Spell</strong>, become the apprentice of Fizzlewit, an aging wizard that has lost his retirement due to poor investments. As his apprentice, you're tasked with building a shop up from nothing to earn enough money to fund his twilight years and prove your skills as a spellcaster to earn the title of Master Wizard. But beware: the forest you find your shop in doesn't take kindly to strangers. You'll have to use your wizardly abilities to protect your shop from the dangers of the night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Shop for Adventurers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in numerous products to improve your shop's earning potential. Grow your business from a rickety stall to a proper one-stop shop for adventurers of all callings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.poster.avif?t=1788466033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.webm?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.mp4?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master an Array of Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the dangers of the surrounding forest come to your doorstep. Learn, improve, and master numerous unique spells with different strengths  to better protect your shop. Freely experiment with spells to find your favorites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/964f7273de1e23054ea4127aa2c07532.poster.avif?t=1788466033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/964f7273de1e23054ea4127aa2c07532.webm?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/964f7273de1e23054ea4127aa2c07532.mp4?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop through 5 levels, unlocking new products, decorations, and spells every level. Advance your revenue streams, invest in upgrades, and become the best spellcasting shopkeep in the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.poster.avif?t=1788466033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.webm?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.mp4?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like the stress of combat? Choose freely between Aspiring Shopkeeper and Aspiring Wizard modes. In Aspiring Shopkeeper mode, you can sit back, relax, and let the money roll in!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> Sell &amp; Spell</strong>, become the apprentice of Fizzlewit, an aging wizard that has lost his retirement due to poor investments. As his apprentice, you're tasked with building a shop up from nothing to earn enough money to fund his twilight years and prove your skills as a spellcaster to earn the title of Master Wizard. But beware: the forest you find your shop in doesn't take kindly to strangers. You'll have to use your wizardly abilities to protect your shop from the dangers of the night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Shop for Adventurers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in numerous products to improve your shop's earning potential. Grow your business from a rickety stall to a proper one-stop shop for adventurers of all callings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.poster.avif?t=1788466033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.webm?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.mp4?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master an Array of Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the dangers of the surrounding forest come to your doorstep. Learn, improve, and master numerous unique spells with different strengths  to better protect your shop. Freely experiment with spells to find your favorites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/964f7273de1e23054ea4127aa2c07532.poster.avif?t=1788466033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/964f7273de1e23054ea4127aa2c07532.webm?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/964f7273de1e23054ea4127aa2c07532.mp4?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop through 5 levels, unlocking new products, decorations, and spells every level. Advance your revenue streams, invest in upgrades, and become the best spellcasting shopkeep in the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.poster.avif?t=1788466033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.webm?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163430/extras/5738ad436323e96ec2926d7c44ca8765.mp4?t=1788466033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like the stress of combat? Choose freely between Aspiring Shopkeeper and Aspiring Wizard modes. In Aspiring Shopkeeper mode, you can sit back, relax, and let the money roll in!</p>",
        "short_description": "A relaxing/idle shopkeeper game by day and challenging top-down defense shooter by night, Sell &amp; Spell combines genres to bring you a unique and fun experience! Establish your business from nothing, save your mentor's retirement, and earn the title of Master Wizard.",
